<body>
<h1>SALIN: A VOICE TRANSCRIPTION AND TRANSLATION WEB APP FOR ENGLISH, FILIPINO, AND BISAYA</h1>
<p><strong>Dela Cruz, Cresadel M.</strong></p>
<p><strong>November 2026</strong></p>
<hr>
<h1>SALIN: A VOICE TRANSCRIPTION AND TRANSLATION WEB APP FOR ENGLISH, FILIPINO, AND BISAYA</h1>
<p>A Project Paper Presented to Mr. James Bernard C. Febrio Instructor of the Institute of Computer Studies Tangub City Global College</p>
<p>In Partial Fulfillment of the Course</p>
<p>Multimedia Systems</p>
<p>Dela Cruz, Cresadel M.</p>
<p>November 2026</p>
<hr>
